{
  "about": "The one inventory of the Mac preload bridge. preload.ts stays hand-written; the preload test (via macos-bridge.ts), main IPC test and both smoke harnesses check against this list. argument: none = zero arguments; one = exactly one literal that main checks against an allowlist (sample is a valid value); callback = event subscription.",
